    "phase_2": "--refit DIR under any numpy+scikit-learn interpreter (no orion import): verify the design digest, mirror _select/_fit with the v1.2 lbfgs contract, predict the protected test set, compare per-case against the archived result, and classify the attractor by numeric canary (full sha256 of the converged serialized-arm coefficient bytes).",
