  "question": "Reopened #1086 box: the locked 0.50-vs-0.75 serialized-arm divergence. Which factor differs between the 0.50 replay and the 0.75 preflight -- input snapshot, code path, environment, seed, or evaluator/arm config? The bar for resolved: reproduce BOTH numbers on demand by toggling that one factor.",
